        },
        {
          "text": "Khona-ke uJayeli umkaHebhere wathatha isikhonkwane etendeni waphatha isando ngesandla sakhe, waya kuye ngobumnene, wasibethela isikhonkwane ezinhlafunweni zakhe, wasigxisha emhlabathini, ngoba wayelele ubuthongo obukhulu futhi ekhathele. Ngakho wafa.",
