            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, uBaraki esaxosha uSisera, uJayeli waphuma ukumhlangabeza, wathi kuye: “Woza, ngikubonise umuntu omfunayo.” Lapho engena etendeni lakhe, bheka, uSisera wayelele efile, isikhonkwane sisethempelini lakhe.",
